{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0123Z7rQBAx6XWnVzzCrXfGp","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code release notes latest\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Releases · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.274 (was v2.1.273) · Issue #1535 · agent-sh/agnix\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1535\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code: A Systematic Analysis and Discussion of Claude Code for Designing Today's and Future AI Agent Systems · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Release Notes.md · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://gist.github.com/doggy8088/ff1e63d9ebefaa97f393119a38dd374b\"},{\"title\":\"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.287 (was v2.1.285) · Issue #1598 · agent-sh/agnix\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1598\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · anthropics/claude-code-action\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Release v2.1.274 · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.274\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code 2.1.289 is out: automatic compat updates are off · Issue #140 · duysqubix/claude-office\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/duysqubix/claude-office/issues/140\"},{\"title\":\"claude-code/CHANGELOG.md at main · anthropics-claude/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics-claude/claude-code/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\"},{\"title\":\"Release v2.1.287 · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.287\"}]\n\nBased on the latest web search results, here are the most recent Claude Code release notes:\n\n## Latest Release: v2.1.289\n\nThe most recent version (v2.1.289) added agent.spawn for teammates, one agent id across plugin hook events, and idle and waiting states in $.agent.list(). It also fixed sessions ending with \"unrecoverable interface error\" when a value a mod's ui.render hook wrote made a row throw while drawn; the engine now draws its own row instead.\n\nOther recent fixes in v2.1.289 include:\n- Fixed a deny or ask rule on a nested part of a compound shell command not holding over a user-installed mod's approval on managed machines\n- Fixed the terminal freezing on short code blocks with many unclosed tags or deeply nested substitutions\n- Fixed Read deny rules not applying to files @-mentioned, changed, or selected in the IDE through a symlink\n\n## Previous Recent Release: v2.1.287\n\nv2.1.287 added URL prompts from MCP servers on the 2025-11-25 protocol, for example to sign in. It also fixed background sessions that could not be reopened from claude agents after the agent exited and removed the worktree the session was started in.\n\nFor the complete and most up-to-date release notes, you can visit the [official Claude Code GitHub releases page](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3bb09052-4dc5-4af1-becb-f762cbbacf07","uuid":"9d723faa-2406-4cca-876c-db7ec4884e97","timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:44:13.207Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Claude Code release notes latest","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WE1gNmtxKr6CNCxWLrGGKm","content":[{"title":"Releases · anthropics/claude-code","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases"},{"title":"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.274 (was v2.1.273) · Issue #1535 · agent-sh/agnix","url":"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1535"},{"title":"GitHub - VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code: A Systematic Analysis and Discussion of Claude Code for Designing Today's and Future AI Agent Systems · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code"},{"title":"Claude Code Release Notes.md · GitHub","url":"https://gist.github.com/doggy8088/ff1e63d9ebefaa97f393119a38dd374b"},{"title":"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.287 (was v2.1.285) · Issue #1598 · agent-sh/agnix","url":"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1598"},{"title":"Releases · anthropics/claude-code-action","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/releases"},{"title":"Release v2.1.274 · anthropics/claude-code","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.274"},{"title":"Claude Code 2.1.289 is out: automatic compat updates are off · Issue #140 · duysqubix/claude-office","url":"https://github.com/duysqubix/claude-office/issues/140"},{"title":"claude-code/CHANGELOG.md at main · anthropics-claude/claude-code","url":"https://github.com/anthropics-claude/claude-code/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md"},{"title":"Release v2.1.287 · anthropics/claude-code","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.287"}]},"Based on the latest web search results, here are the most recent Claude Code release notes:\n\n## Latest Release: v2.1.289\n\nThe most recent version (v2.1.289) added agent.spawn for teammates, one agent id across plugin hook events, and idle and waiting states in $.agent.list(). It also fixed sessions ending with \"unrecoverable interface error\" when a value a mod's ui.render hook wrote made a row throw while drawn; the engine now draws its own row instead.\n\nOther recent fixes in v2.1.289 include:\n- Fixed a deny or ask rule on a nested part of a compound shell command not holding over a user-installed mod's approval on managed machines\n- Fixed the terminal freezing on short code blocks with many unclosed tags or deeply nested substitutions\n- Fixed Read deny rules not applying to files @-mentioned, changed, or selected in the IDE through a symlink\n\n## Previous Recent Release: v2.1.287\n\nv2.1.287 added URL prompts from MCP servers on the 2025-11-25 protocol, for example to sign in. It also fixed background sessions that could not be reopened from claude agents after the agent exited and removed the worktree the session was started in.\n\nFor the complete and most up-to-date release notes, you can visit the [official Claude Code GitHub releases page](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases)."],"durationSeconds":7.703280866,"searchCount":1}}
